        'decision-desk':`<div class="retro-work-app retro-decision-desk"><header><small>RECORDS / CHOICE ENGINE</small><h3>Decision Desk</h3><p>Give each choice its own line. Optional weights use “Choice | weight”. The desk will make a fair weighted draw.</p></header><textarea data-decision-options rows="8" placeholder="Tea | 2\nCoffee | 1\nGo for a walk | 3"></textarea><div class="retro-decision-result" data-decision-result>THE DESK IS WAITING FOR YOUR OPTIONS.</div><div class="retro-work-toolbar"><button type="button" data-decision-draw>Make a choice</button><button type="button" data-decision-copy>Copy result</button><button type="button" data-decision-save>Save result to C:</button></div><p data-decision-status>Weights must be positive numbers. The draw is performed locally.</p></div>`,
        'backup-verifier':`<div class="retro-work-app retro-backup-verifier"><header><small>SERVICE WING / INTEGRITY CHECK</small><h3>Backup Verifier</h3><p>Calculate a SHA-256 fingerprint for a backup or any file. The file is not uploaded.</p></header><label>Choose a file <input type="file" data-bv-file></label><div class="retro-work-toolbar"><button type="button" data-bv-hash disabled>Calculate SHA-256</button><button type="button" data-bv-copy disabled>Copy fingerprint</button></div><div class="retro-bv-report" data-bv-report>WAITING FOR A FILE</div><p data-bv-status>Use the same file later to compare its fingerprint. A matching SHA-256 is a strong integrity check, not proof of file safety.</p></div>`,
