          const lines = [`I can help think it through. I do not have lived experience or personal beliefs, but I can compare the strengths, trade-offs and different viewpoints around ${subject}. What part interests you most?`,`My first instinct is to look at what works, what does not, and who benefits. With ${subject}, which side are you most curious about?`,`That is a good conversation topic. I would rather explore the reasons than pretend there is one obvious answer. What is your own take on ${subject}?`];
