      if(id==='market')body=`<div class="food-os-market-head"><div><small>YOUR KITCHEN BALANCE</small><b><span data-food-market-flavor>0</span> Flavor</b><p data-food-market-rate>+0 Flavor / sec</p></div><span class="food-os-market-no-reset">LOCAL PROGRESS · NO DEADLINES · NO RESET</span></div><div class="food-os-market-grid"><section class="food-os-market-panel food-os-market-rules"><div class="food-os-market-section-head"><div><small>01 / BUILD YOUR STYLE</small><h3>Kitchen Rules</h3><p>Choose from the full predictable catalogue. Equipped rules evaluate left to right.</p></div></div><div class="food-os-equipped-rules" data-food-equipped-rules></div><div class="food-os-rule-catalogue" data-food-market-rules></div></section><section class="food-os-market-panel"><div class="food-os-market-section-head"><div><small>02 / KITCHEN SYSTEMS</small><h3>Quiet upgrades</h3><p>Small permanent improvements. Nothing buys itself.</p></div></div><div class="food-os-upgrade-card"><div><b>Line Cook</b><p>Increase the passive Flavor your cookbook earns while Nourish is open and visible.</p><small data-food-line-cook-level>LEVEL 0 / 5</small></div><button type="button" data-food-buy-line-cook>Upgrade · 125 Flavor</button></div><div class="food-os-upgrade-card"><div><b>Kitchen Rule slots</b><p>Start with two equipped slots. Expand to five whenever you are ready.</p><small data-food-rule-slots>2 / 5 SLOTS</small></div><button type="button" data-food-buy-rule-slot>Unlock slot · 280 Flavor</button></div></section><section class="food-os-market-panel food-os-kitchen-note-panel"><div class="food-os-market-section-head"><div><small>03 / A LITTLE INSPIRATION</small><h3>Kitchen Note</h3><p>A gentle pairing request with no deadline. Finish it when the ingredients naturally come together.</p></div></div><div data-food-market-note></div><button type="button" class="food-os-market-secondary" data-food-note-next>Choose another note</button></section><section class="food-os-market-panel"><div class="food-os-market-section-head"><div><small>04 / COOKBOOK MILESTONES</small><h3>Long-term discoveries</h3><p>Permanent milestones celebrate your collection. Nothing is wiped or reborn.</p></div></div><div class="food-os-milestones" data-food-market-milestones></div><p class="food-os-app-note">Flavor is local to this Nourish installation and is included in your cookbook backup. Existing discoveries are carried forward and marked as already rewarded, so they cannot be replayed for duplicate payouts.</p></section></div>`;
      if(id==='discovery')body=`<div class="food-os-lab-hero"><span>✧</span><div><small>INFINITE RECIPE LAB / DISCOVERY ENGINE</small><h3>There are more combinations than you can count.</h3><p>Combine known ingredients, then use discoveries as new ingredients. First-time pairings earn Flavor, and the lab can find an untried pair whenever you want a surprise.</p></div></div><div class="food-os-lab-stats"><div><b data-food-lab-items>0</b><small>KNOWN ITEMS</small></div><div><b data-food-lab-found>0</b><small>PAIRS DISCOVERED</small></div><div><b data-food-lab-remaining>0</b><small>UNTRIED PAIRS</small></div></div><div class="food-os-lab-progress"><i data-food-lab-progress></i></div><section class="food-os-lab-flavor-card"><div><small>YOUR KITCHEN ECONOMY</small><b><span data-food-lab-flavor>0</span> Flavor</b><p><span data-food-lab-rate>+0/s</span> · Earned from first-time pair discoveries and a gentle local passive bonus.</p></div><button type="button" data-food-open-market>Open Kitchen Market ↗</button></section><div class="food-os-lab-actions"><button type="button" class="food-os-primary-action" data-food-lab-surprise>✧ Discover a new combination</button><button type="button" data-food-open-pantry>Open Pantry</button><button type="button" data-food-open-library>Open Recipe Library</button></div><h4 class="food-os-lab-section-title">RECENT DISCOVERIES</h4><div class="food-os-lab-recent" data-food-lab-recent></div><p class="food-os-app-note">The lab is virtual. Flavor profiles are estimated from ingredient tendencies, not measured in a laboratory. Try ideas at home only when you choose, using safe preparation and allergen checks.</p>`;
      if(id==='fusion')body=`<div class="food-os-empty-detail"><span>✣</span><b>The ingredient work surface is your desktop.</b><p>Close this window and place ingredients on the desktop to combine them.</p></div>`;
      if(id==='pantry')body=`<div class="food-os-app-toolbar"><input type="search" data-food-pantry-search placeholder="Search pantry ingredients…"><span data-food-pantry-count>${allItems().filter(x=>x.kind==='ingredient').length} ITEMS</span></div><div class="food-os-pantry-grid" data-food-pantry-grid></div><form class="food-os-add-form" data-food-custom-form><input type="text" data-food-custom-input maxlength="40" placeholder="Add your own ingredient…" aria-label="New ingredient name"><button type="submit">+ Add item</button></form><p class="food-os-app-note">Start with Bacon and Apple. Earn Flavor by discovering authored dishes, then unlock ingredients from the Pantry. Each new unlock costs more than the last. Drag unlocked ingredients onto the desktop or use Add to Desktop for touchscreens.</p>`;
