      <p class="aura-arcade-disclaimer">WORD REGISTER: ${AURA_18_LETTER_WORDS.length} UNIQUE ALPHABETIC ENTRIES, EACH EXACTLY 18 LETTERS. Compiled from published WordDB and Wordmom long-word lists plus verified lexical entries. Rare, scientific, technical and inflected forms are included. This is an in-app candidate register, not a definitive unabridged dictionary. The source projects are credited in the bundled release documentation; no dictionary page is fetched at runtime.</p>
